{"conversationId":3,"title":"Sordland/Turn01/A_Media","storyPack":"StoryPack_Main","turn":1,"turnLabel":"Turn 1","isDevNote":false,"rootNodeId":0,"nodes":{"0":{"id":0,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":1}]},"1":{"id":1,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":79}]},"2":{"id":2,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[]},"3":{"id":3,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“He has offered to meet with you, Mr. President.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":82},{"convId":3,"nodeId":83},{"convId":3,"nodeId":84}]},"4":{"id":4,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“But let's not get ahead of ourselves. First, we need to determine our general approach to media.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":26}]},"5":{"id":5,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“The media must be independent.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":9}]},"6":{"id":6,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“The media is a tool to be used.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":136}]},"7":{"id":7,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“I agree. Media plays a huge role in adapting public opinion towards our views and policies, while helping us avoid damage from scandals or mistakes.\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGame.Democratic","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGame.Democratic\"] - 1"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":8}]},"8":{"id":8,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“While I do acknowledge that this will sound a bit harsh, I certainly believe that our perspective, knowledge and experience allows us to have superior judgement compared to the average Sordish citizen.\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":15},{"convId":3,"nodeId":16},{"convId":3,"nodeId":17}]},"9":{"id":9,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“Ideally, yes. But an unpopular leader will not be able to pass even the easiest reforms. It is of utmost importance to maintain public popularity and avoid any damaging scandals or mistakes.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":10}]},"10":{"id":10,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“I must stress one thing, Mr. President. The more people we have supporting our agenda, the more we can accomplish. With someone on our side in an influential media organisation, we can do this very easily.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":15},{"convId":3,"nodeId":14},{"convId":3,"nodeId":17}]},"11":{"id":11,"speaker":"Petr Vectern","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“I agree with Lucian, but why the assumption there'll be scandals and mistakes?”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":20}]},"12":{"id":12,"speaker":"Petr Vectern","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“They are a powerful and influential media conglomerate. To start with, they own the Sordland Today newspaper, the Sordish Broadcasting Corporation, the S-”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":87}]},"13":{"id":13,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“After the passing of his father -- may he rest in peace -- Marcel aims to become the next CEO of the HOS Conglomerate. He mentioned a productive collaboration.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":12}]},"14":{"id":14,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“Two wrongs don't make a right.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":101}]},"15":{"id":15,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“I see what you are getting at.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":11}]},"16":{"id":16,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“That does sound harsh.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":21}]},"17":{"id":17,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“I share your opinion.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":23}]},"18":{"id":18,"speaker":"Petr Vectern","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“Maybe, maybe not. It's hard to forget what happened to President Alphonso last year.”","conditionsRaw":"(Variable[\"BaseGame.Prologue_Party_Takeover_Backstab\"] == true) == false","variablesRead":[{"var":"BaseGame.Prologue_Party_Takeover_Backstab","op":"==","value":"true"}],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":19}]},"19":{"id":19,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“Things got even worse after his cabinet resigned and the media started to slander him, but that was also a result of his own incompetence.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":27}]},"20":{"id":20,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“We can always hope for the best. But do we really think that nothing can go wrong? Especially considering the very recent history of Sordland.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":27}]},"21":{"id":21,"speaker":"Petr Vectern","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“Yes, we shouldn't resort to these measures to solve our potential political mistakes.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":22}]},"22":{"id":22,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“It isn't about that alone, Petr. There could be groups or people who would want to damage us even if we are in the right.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":27}]},"23":{"id":23,"speaker":"Petr Vectern","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“I concur. Even if we don't use it, we should be able to have control over it.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":24}]},"24":{"id":24,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“You both are aware of my certain expertise with public opinion swaying. I will make sure the media is on our side.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":27}]},"25":{"id":25,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“There are two ways we can approach the media. One of them is by influencing it, which has clear advantages. The other one is keeping it independent.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":5},{"convId":3,"nodeId":6}]},"26":{"id":26,"speaker":"Petr Vectern","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“I'm no media expert, but Lucian made some very interesting arguments at the preparation meeting yesterday.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":25}]},"27":{"id":27,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"Two knocks were heard on the door.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":28},{"convId":3,"nodeId":29}]},"28":{"id":28,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“Please, come in.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":129}]},"29":{"id":29,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“Who is it?”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":130}]},"30":{"id":30,"speaker":"Livia Suno","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“Excuse me, Mr. President. Mr. Galade's secretary has been calling me and wanted me to relay a message.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":35}]},"31":{"id":31,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"Livia Suno, my new secretary, entered the office.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameSupport.Codex_Characters_Others_LiviaSuno","op":"=","value":"true"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":138}]},"32":{"id":32,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"The Korontis had always been known as one of the richest and most influential families in Sordland. Marcel Koronti was no exception.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":107}]},"33":{"id":33,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“What does this *productive collaboration* entail?”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":112}]},"34":{"id":34,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“Let's consider our options first. No need to be hasty.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":110}]},"35":{"id":35,"speaker":"Livia Suno","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“Marcel Koronti, the new CEO for HOS Conglomerate, is on the line for Mr. Galade.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":36}]},"36":{"id":36,"speaker":"Petr Vectern","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“Well. The ball is in our court now.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":90}]},"37":{"id":37,"speaker":"Livia Suno","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“Right away, sir. Connecting the call to line one.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGame.Turn01_Admin_TalkedToMarcel","op":"=","value":"true"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":158}]},"38":{"id":38,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"Livia left the room and the phone started ringing. I picked it up.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":51},{"convId":3,"nodeId":52},{"convId":3,"nodeId":53}]},"39":{"id":39,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“Good news indeed. Congratulations, Mr. Koronti. Thank you for contacting me about this. We will talk later.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":40}]},"40":{"id":40,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"Lucian put the phone down.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":41}]},"41":{"id":41,"speaker":"Petr Vectern","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“What was so important that it couldn't wait?”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":42}]},"42":{"id":42,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“He was just elected CEO by the board of directors. He offered a partnership deal regarding his media branch. He is inviting us to his resort near Conriat for a meeting.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":132}]},"43":{"id":43,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“Arrange the meeting with Mr. Koronti.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":69}]},"44":{"id":44,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“I do not want to associate with a media mogul. Reject the offer.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":70}]},"45":{"id":45,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“I would like to hear your opinion, Petr.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":65}]},"46":{"id":46,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGame.Turn01_Admin_Meeting","op":"=","value":"true"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":133}]},"47":{"id":47,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“You go ahead. Connect the line to my office.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":91}]},"48":{"id":48,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“I'll talk to him. Connect the line to my office.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":137}]},"49":{"id":49,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"A few minutes passed as the two talked over the phone.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":39}]},"50":{"id":50,"speaker":"Marcel Koronti","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“The pleasure is all mine.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":58}]},"51":{"id":51,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“The President speaking.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":56}]},"52":{"id":52,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“It's a pleasure, Mr. Koronti.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":50}]},"53":{"id":53,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“Hello, Marcel.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":55}]},"54":{"id":54,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“He is going to offer a real deal and now has the power of the conglomerate too. The choice is up to you, Mr. President. I can set up the meeting soon.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":45},{"convId":3,"nodeId":43},{"convId":3,"nodeId":44}]},"55":{"id":55,"speaker":"Marcel Koronti","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“Greetings, Mr. Rayne.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":58}]},"56":{"id":56,"speaker":"Marcel Koronti","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“It's an honor, Mr. President.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":58}]},"57":{"id":57,"speaker":"Petr Vectern","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“The board has decided rather quickly. It seems that gave him the confidence to approach us again.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameSupport.Codex_Organisations_Corporations_HOS","op":"=","value":"false"},{"var":"BaseGameSupport.Codex_Organisations_Corporations_HOS_KonrathDead","op":"=","value":"true"},{"var":"BaseGameSupport.Codex_Characters_Business_MarcelKoronti","op":"=","value":"false"},{"var":"BaseGameSupport.Codex_Characters_Business_MarcelKoronti_KonrathDead","op":"=","value":"true"},{"var":"BaseGameSupport.Codex_Characters_Business_KonrathKoronti","op":"=","value":"false"},{"var":"BaseGameSupport.Codex_Characters_Business_KonrathKoronti_Dead","op":"=","value":"true"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":54}]},"58":{"id":58,"speaker":"Marcel Koronti","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“I know your time is valuable, so I will not waste any of it. I was just elected CEO of HOS.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":131}]},"59":{"id":59,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“Thank you for the offer. I would be interested in a meeting.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":61}]},"60":{"id":60,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“Thank you for your offer, Mr. Koronti, but I have to refuse.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":62}]},"61":{"id":61,"speaker":"Marcel Koronti","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“You will not be disappointed, I promise.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":64}]},"62":{"id":62,"speaker":"Marcel Koronti","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“That is a shame. Thank you for your time nonetheless.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":77}]},"63":{"id":63,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"Mr. Koronti hung up the phone without waiting for my response.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":70}]},"64":{"id":64,"speaker":"Marcel Koronti","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“Well then, I will let you return to your packed schedule. See you later, Mr. President.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":100},{"convId":3,"nodeId":98}]},"65":{"id":65,"speaker":"Petr Vectern","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“I have to say I'm torn. If he has become the CEO, then he has enormous influence now. On the other hand, do we want to privately meet with someone we don't fully know?”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":66}]},"66":{"id":66,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“The meeting would help us figure him out. We could still say no to whatever he offers.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":67},{"convId":3,"nodeId":68}]},"67":{"id":67,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“Arrange the meeting with Mr. Koronti.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":69}]},"68":{"id":68,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“I do not want to associate with a media mogul. Reject the offer.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":70}]},"69":{"id":69,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“I'll set things up right away. Expect a worthwhile meeting next month.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":46}]},"70":{"id":70,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“That is a clear no. Very well. I hope we have made the right call.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":135}]},"71":{"id":71,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“It appears we're done for today. We will continue where we left off later. Thank you for your time.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":114},{"convId":3,"nodeId":73}]},"72":{"id":72,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“Good work with Marcel. Keep it up.”","conditionsRaw":"Variable[\"BaseGame.Turn01_Admin_Meeting\"] == true","variablesRead":[{"var":"BaseGame.Turn01_Admin_Meeting","op":"==","value":"true"}],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":113}]},"73":{"id":73,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“See you soon, gentlemen.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":94}]},"74":{"id":74,"speaker":"Petr Vectern","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“It's settled then. Looking forward to next month. I wonder if he has a pool?”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGame.Turn01_Admin_Meeting","op":"=","value":"true"},{"var":"BaseGameSupport.Journal_Turn01_AcceptedMarcelOfferToMeet","op":"=","value":"true"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":93}]},"75":{"id":75,"speaker":"Petr Vectern","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“Well, that makes things clear. We should focus on other things anyway.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameSupport.Journal_Turn01_RejectedMarcelOfferToMeet","op":"=","value":"true"},{"var":"BaseGame.Public_Opinion","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGame.Public_Opinion\"] - 2"},{"var":"GameCondition.Turn02_A_MediaDeal","op":"=","value":"true"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":93}]},"76":{"id":76,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"GameCondition.Turn01_A_Media","op":"=","value":"true"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":160}]},"77":{"id":77,"speaker":"Marcel Koronti","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“Good luck in the future.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":63}]},"78":{"id":78,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"We were already getting the attention of key figures -- and potentially dangerous ones.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":121}]},"79":{"id":79,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"Lucian and Petr arrived at my office to talk about recent developments and the media strategy.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":119}]},"80":{"id":80,"speaker":"Marcel Koronti","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“This is why I am offering a partnership deal regarding our media branch. I would like to formally invite you to my resort near Conriat for a meeting to discuss the details.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":95},{"convId":3,"nodeId":59},{"convId":3,"nodeId":60}]},"81":{"id":81,"speaker":"Marcel Koronti","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“My strategy in the running of this conglomerate will be different than my father's approach.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameSupport.Codex_Organisations_Corporations_HOS","op":"=","value":"false"},{"var":"BaseGameSupport.Codex_Organisations_Corporations_HOS_KonrathDead","op":"=","value":"true"},{"var":"BaseGameSupport.Codex_Characters_Business_MarcelKoronti","op":"=","value":"false"},{"var":"BaseGameSupport.Codex_Characters_Business_MarcelKoronti_KonrathDead","op":"=","value":"true"},{"var":"BaseGameSupport.Codex_Characters_Business_KonrathKoronti","op":"=","value":"false"},{"var":"BaseGameSupport.Codex_Characters_Business_KonrathKoronti_Dead","op":"=","value":"true"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":80}]},"82":{"id":82,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“What does he want?”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":13}]},"83":{"id":83,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“Why is Konrath sending his son?”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":86}]},"84":{"id":84,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“Why should I meet with him?”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":13}]},"85":{"id":85,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"Lucian turned to me.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":3}]},"86":{"id":86,"speaker":"Petr Vectern","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“He, uh, unfortunately passed away today.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":13}]},"87":{"id":87,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“Which means it would be wise to have them by our side. Sorry for interrupting.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":33},{"convId":3,"nodeId":34},{"convId":3,"nodeId":108}]},"88":{"id":88,"speaker":"Livia Suno","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“It's Livia, Mr. President.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameSupport.Codex_Characters_Others_LiviaSuno","op":"=","value":"true"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":89}]},"89":{"id":89,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"Livia Suno, my new secretary, entered the office.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":138}]},"90":{"id":90,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“Would you like to talk to him, sir, or would you like me to?”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":48},{"convId":3,"nodeId":47}]},"91":{"id":91,"speaker":"Livia Suno","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“Right away, sir. Connecting the call to line one.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":164}]},"92":{"id":92,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"Livia left the room and the phone started ringing. Lucian picked it up.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":49}]},"93":{"id":93,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"Lucian looked at his watch.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":71}]},"94":{"id":94,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"Lucian and Petr gathered their documents and promptly left my office.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":78}]},"95":{"id":95,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“What does that entail?”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":96}]},"96":{"id":96,"speaker":"Marcel Koronti","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“Our future as partners, Mr. President. Surely, we can't talk about the details on the phone. I just wish to have a face to face conversation with you.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":97}]},"97":{"id":97,"speaker":"Marcel Koronti","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“I will send you the details through my secretary if you are interested.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":59},{"convId":3,"nodeId":60}]},"98":{"id":98,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“See you later, Mr. Koronti.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":99}]},"99":{"id":99,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"I hung up the phone.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":69}]},"100":{"id":100,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“Goodbye.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":99}]},"101":{"id":101,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":102},{"convId":3,"nodeId":103}]},"102":{"id":102,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":"Variable[\"BaseGame.Prologue_Party_Takeover_Backstab\"] == true","variablesRead":[{"var":"BaseGame.Prologue_Party_Takeover_Backstab","op":"==","value":"true"}],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":104}]},"103":{"id":103,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":"(Variable[\"BaseGame.Prologue_Party_Takeover_Backstab\"] == true) == false","variablesRead":[{"var":"BaseGame.Prologue_Party_Takeover_Backstab","op":"==","value":"true"}],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":18}]},"104":{"id":104,"speaker":"Petr Vectern","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“Says the man who used the media to backstab President Alphonso last year.”","conditionsRaw":"Variable[\"BaseGame.Prologue_Party_Takeover_Backstab\"] == true","variablesRead":[{"var":"BaseGame.Prologue_Party_Takeover_Backstab","op":"==","value":"true"}],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":19}]},"105":{"id":105,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"They both took their seats across from me. Lucian put on his reading glasses and quickly went over some documents. Petr turned to Lucian and nodded.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameSupport.News_Turn01_G_Relations","op":"=","value":"true"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":106}]},"106":{"id":106,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“Greetings, gentlemen.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":139}]},"107":{"id":107,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"He was the oldest son of Konrath Koronti, the industrialist and media mogul who founded HOS. The richest man in the entirety of Sordland.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":85}]},"108":{"id":108,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“Sounds like there is potential there.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":111}]},"109":{"id":109,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“However, as Petr said, they have substantial power over the content of media outlets. Headlines, radio shows. That is what he would be offering. What he wants in return is what we need to understand.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":4}]},"110":{"id":110,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“I agree. We need to be careful.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":4}]},"111":{"id":111,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“There is definitely potential. A potential that could go both ways.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":4}]},"112":{"id":112,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“He did not wish to explain the details over the phone but rather in person. I believe I will be receiving a call from him sometime soon.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":109}]},"113":{"id":113,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"Lucian and Petr nodded before gathering their documents and leaving my office.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":78}]},"114":{"id":114,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":115},{"convId":3,"nodeId":116}]},"115":{"id":115,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":"Variable[\"BaseGame.Turn01_Admin_Meeting\"] == true","variablesRead":[{"var":"BaseGame.Turn01_Admin_Meeting","op":"==","value":"true"}],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":72}]},"116":{"id":116,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":"(Variable[\"BaseGame.Turn01_Admin_Meeting\"] == true) == false","variablesRead":[{"var":"BaseGame.Turn01_Admin_Meeting","op":"==","value":"true"}],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":117}]},"117":{"id":117,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“I expect you to bring better allies to the table.”","conditionsRaw":"(Variable[\"BaseGame.Turn01_Admin_Meeting\"] == true) == false","variablesRead":[{"var":"BaseGame.Turn01_Admin_Meeting","op":"==","value":"true"}],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":113}]},"118":{"id":118,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameSupport.News_Turn01_R_GlamorousBall","op":"=","value":"true"},{"var":"BaseGameSupport.News_Turn01_ST_KonrathPassed","op":"=","value":"true"},{"var":"BaseGameSupport.News_Turn01_ST_HSURavaged","op":"=","value":"true"},{"var":"BaseGameSupport.Report_Turn01_Holsord_SIDFireReport","op":"=","value":"true"},{"var":"BaseGameSupport.CountryReport_Turn01_Kyrute_PraisesDemocracy","op":"=","value":"true"},{"var":"BaseGameSupport.News_Turn01_LT_GasomFreezesHiring","op":"=","value":"true"},{"var":"BaseGameSupport.Report_Turn01_Ribery_TourismIndicator","op":"=","value":"true"},{"var":"BaseGameSupport.Report_Turn01_Valgen_DamOutputReduces","op":"=","value":"true"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":165}]},"119":{"id":119,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameSupport.News_Turn01_G_Relations","op":"=","value":"true"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":105}]},"120":{"id":120,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameSupport.Report_Turn01_Holsord_AutocratCommittee","op":"=","value":"true"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":118}]},"121":{"id":121,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":122},{"convId":3,"nodeId":123}]},"122":{"id":122,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":"Variable[\"BaseGame.Reform_Autocrat_Intention\"] == true","variablesRead":[{"var":"BaseGame.Reform_Autocrat_Intention","op":"==","value":"true"}],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":120}]},"123":{"id":123,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":"(Variable[\"BaseGame.Reform_Autocrat_Intention\"] == true) == false","variablesRead":[{"var":"BaseGame.Reform_Autocrat_Intention","op":"==","value":"true"}],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":124}]},"124":{"id":124,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":125},{"convId":3,"nodeId":126}]},"125":{"id":125,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":"Variable[\"BaseGame.Reform_Dictator_Intention\"] == true","variablesRead":[{"var":"BaseGame.Reform_Dictator_Intention","op":"==","value":"true"}],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":127}]},"126":{"id":126,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":"(Variable[\"BaseGame.Reform_Dictator_Intention\"] == true) == false","variablesRead":[{"var":"BaseGame.Reform_Dictator_Intention","op":"==","value":"true"}],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":128}]},"127":{"id":127,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameSupport.Report_Turn01_Holsord_DictatorCommittee","op":"=","value":"true"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":118}]},"128":{"id":128,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameSupport.Report_Turn01_Holsord_ReformistCommittee","op":"=","value":"true"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":118}]},"129":{"id":129,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameSupport.Codex_Characters_Others_LiviaSuno","op":"=","value":"true"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":31}]},"130":{"id":130,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameSupport.Codex_Characters_Others_LiviaSuno","op":"=","value":"true"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":88}]},"131":{"id":131,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameSupport.Codex_Organisations_Corporations_HOS","op":"=","value":"false"},{"var":"BaseGameSupport.Codex_Organisations_Corporations_HOS_KonrathDead","op":"=","value":"true"},{"var":"BaseGameSupport.Codex_Characters_Business_MarcelKoronti","op":"=","value":"false"},{"var":"BaseGameSupport.Codex_Characters_Business_MarcelKoronti_KonrathDead","op":"=","value":"true"},{"var":"BaseGameSupport.Codex_Characters_Business_KonrathKoronti","op":"=","value":"false"},{"var":"BaseGameSupport.Codex_Characters_Business_KonrathKoronti_Dead","op":"=","value":"true"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":81}]},"132":{"id":132,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameSupport.Codex_Organisations_Corporations_HOS","op":"=","value":"false"},{"var":"BaseGameSupport.Codex_Organisations_Corporations_HOS_KonrathDead","op":"=","value":"true"},{"var":"BaseGameSupport.Codex_Characters_Business_MarcelKoronti","op":"=","value":"false"},{"var":"BaseGameSupport.Codex_Characters_Business_MarcelKoronti_KonrathDead","op":"=","value":"true"},{"var":"BaseGameSupport.Codex_Characters_Business_KonrathKoronti","op":"=","value":"false"},{"var":"BaseGameSupport.Codex_Characters_Business_KonrathKoronti_Dead","op":"=","value":"true"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":57}]},"133":{"id":133,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameSupport.Journal_Turn01_AcceptedMarcelOfferToMeet","op":"=","value":"true"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":74}]},"134":{"id":134,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGameSupport.Journal_Turn01_RejectedMarcelOfferToMeet","op":"=","value":"true"},{"var":"BaseGame.Public_Opinion","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGame.Public_Opinion\"] - 2"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":75}]},"135":{"id":135,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"GameCondition.Turn02_A_MediaDeal","op":"=","value":"true"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":134}]},"136":{"id":136,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGame.Democratic","op":"=","value":"Variable[\"BaseGame.Democratic\"] - 1"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":7}]},"137":{"id":137,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGame.Turn01_Admin_TalkedToMarcel","op":"=","value":"true"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":37}]},"138":{"id":138,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"Her dark curls bounced as she crossed the room to my desk. She spoke with a slight lilt in her voice.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":30}]},"139":{"id":139,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“I have just received further information from the Interior about the sudden fire that broke out at the Holsord State University archives nearby.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":142},{"convId":3,"nodeId":141},{"convId":3,"nodeId":145}]},"140":{"id":140,"speaker":"Petr Vectern","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“Is the SID really necessary for this? Why would anyone hit the archives of a university in the first place? I see no logical motive there.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":149}]},"141":{"id":141,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“Was it put out quickly?”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":143}]},"142":{"id":142,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“Tell me more.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":144}]},"143":{"id":143,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“Our firefighters put out the fire as soon as they could. Yet it had been burning for six hours, so extensive damage was done to the archives and the building.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":148}]},"144":{"id":144,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“The initial reports from the Holsord police chief indicate a potential arson case. In accordance with protocol, the Sordish Intelligence Directorate has been called.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":140}]},"145":{"id":145,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“I'm not interested in the subject.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":146}]},"146":{"id":146,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“Excuse me. Let's just move on.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":147}]},"147":{"id":147,"speaker":"Petr Vectern","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“More importantly, Lucian mentioned that Marcel Koronti contacted him.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":32}]},"148":{"id":148,"speaker":"Petr Vectern","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“I will arrange medals to recognize their bravery for doing their best. The Holsord Fire Department is full of tough champs.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":157}]},"149":{"id":149,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“It seems like the chief suspects foreign sabotage. They informed us that a large section of the archive has been destroyed. It included tens of thousands of globally recognized research documents in original by the great thinkers of our people.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":150},{"convId":3,"nodeId":151},{"convId":3,"nodeId":152}]},"150":{"id":150,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“It's a shame so much knowledge was lost.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":153}]},"151":{"id":151,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“Back to Petr's point. If this was arson, what could the motive have been?\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":154}]},"152":{"id":152,"speaker":"Player","isPlayerChoice":true,"text":"“We need to support our education system to make new discoveries for the future.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":155}]},"153":{"id":153,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“Luckily most originals have copies in the other universities and some international libraries. The first edition of my favorite book, \"The Geopolitics of Sordland\" by Herman Equa, was destroyed too.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":156}]},"154":{"id":154,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“The fact that the employee records have been destroyed along with the research documents raises further questions.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":153}]},"155":{"id":155,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“Preserving our knowledge is as important as expanding on it. It's interesting that the employee records have been destroyed as well.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":153}]},"156":{"id":156,"speaker":"Petr Vectern","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“Maybe it was just a freak accident. We do have the copies of most important works, so no single fire can eradicate our knowledge. I see no point in destroying employee records, either.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":147}]},"157":{"id":157,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"“The information we received raises some eyebrows.”","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":144}]},"158":{"id":158,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":38}]},"159":{"id":159,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[{"var":"BaseGame.Situation_Diplomacy_Energy_PriceFluctuation","op":"=","value":"true"},{"var":"BaseGame.Situation_Diplomacy_Energy_PriceSurge","op":"=","value":"false"},{"var":"BaseGame.Situation_Diplomacy_Energy_PriceBalanced","op":"=","value":"false"}],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":76}]},"160":{"id":160,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":2}]},"161":{"id":161,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":162},{"convId":3,"nodeId":163}]},"162":{"id":162,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":"Variable[\"BaseGame.Prologue_Studyplace_Deyr_History\"] == true","variablesRead":[{"var":"BaseGame.Prologue_Studyplace_Deyr_History","op":"==","value":"true"}],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":76}]},"163":{"id":163,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":"(Variable[\"BaseGame.Prologue_Studyplace_Deyr_History\"] == true) == false","variablesRead":[{"var":"BaseGame.Prologue_Studyplace_Deyr_History","op":"==","value":"true"}],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":159}]},"164":{"id":164,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":92}]},"165":{"id":165,"speaker":"Lucian Galade","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":3,"nodeId":161}]}}}